              "texto": "Introducing people: [[5995|ser to introduce people]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "mi, tu, su",
              "texto": "Whose relative: [[6012|possessive adjectives]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "estoy casado",
              "texto": "Status, not relationship: [[6069|estar for relationship statuses]]."
